WEBVTT

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:38.760
I'm counting on you.

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:41.740
I'm supposed to be studying at
your house today after school.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:44.020
Oh, has it been a week already?

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:49.370
Yagami, does Godai pass as a tutor?

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:54.430
She says Godai is her pillar in the
gray world of exams!

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:55.710
Isn't that so, Yagami?

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:57.820
It must be nice to have a pillar to lean on...

00:01:58.100 --> 00:01:59.520
You're serious?

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:01.790
Of course!

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:07.860
When I can't remember
the English vocabulary,

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:10.500
when I can't figure
out an algebraic problem,

00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:19.310
I look up and I see Godai's sweet smile.
And the anguish disappears.

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:23.140
As long as the English vocabulary
doesn't disappear along with it.

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:27.100
Didn't you know?
Falling in love makes you stupid.

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:28.730
What?!
Really?

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:36.110
Not a problem! Just being with Godai,
breathing the same air...

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:39.290
That's enough for right now...

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:14.700
Let's see...
"Oedipus complex is going after..."

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:18.230
This is hard!

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:21.420
Now that I think about it
it's a miracle I got into college.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:26.100
I don't know if he's conscientious
or just lacks courage...

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:29.810
He's ended up going along
with Yagami.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.040
Good evening!

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:36.250
How are you?

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:37.540
Are you the guard?

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:40.600
I'm cleaning!
Godai!

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:46.130
What is it, Manager?

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:48.100
Yagami is here.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:01.940
Okay, shall we start?

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:05.780
Why are you leaving the door open?

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.010
Why? No particular reason...

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.780
Did the manager tell you to?

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:12.480
Of-Of course not...

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:14.190
Then, close the door.

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:18.020
You can study with the door open!

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.080
I cannot.

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:20.520
Why?

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:21.670
Because!

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.110
What are you doing there!

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.700
I can drink wherever I want.

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:36.310
Godai, why don't you use
red shades?

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:37.550
Why should I?

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.550
It'll bring out the mood.

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:48.560
They're all making fun of me...

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:50.580
They're such a pain.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:06.630
Open your book.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:07.460
Yes!

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:27.000
This is it, this serenity...

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:32.170
Got it! Look here, Yagami.
This problem...

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:32.710
Yes!

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:34.240
Yes?

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:37.450
Excuse me.

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:40.610
I've made some tea...

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:44.610
Thank you...

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:56.860
Just when we were getting
into the mood... That widow!

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:01.010
But why does he have to be
so jumpy?

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:02.960
It's practically
a conditioned response.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:04.670
I'm home.

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:06.520
Oh, you're late, Ibuki.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.830
I told you,
I was studying at Mami's house.

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:12.200
You can study at home!

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:15.680
Helping each other when necessary
makes the studying go smoothly.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:19.050
Then, maybe we should hire a tutor.

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:20.710
A tutor?

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:26.050
Yes, the neighbor was saying she knew
a student at Tokyo University who's good.

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:28.800
It's not a male, is it?

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.190
It is...

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.280
A male's no good!

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:37.580
A young man and a young girl alone,
you can't tell what they're thinking.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:51.570
If Dad ever finds out I'm going
to Godai's...

00:06:57.090 --> 00:07:01.260
How long will this relationship last...?

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:06.190
What are you thinking?!
It can't last forever, you know.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:09.130
That's right.
Your parents will find out in no time.

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:11.200
You should give it up, Ibuki.

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:14.270
Besides, Godai is probably
making it with that widow.

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:20.460
Even if that's true, that's not love!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:26.510
That widow is only giving Godai terror,
tension and oppression!

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:28.770
That must be what he wants.

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:32.260
Godai is a masochist.

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:38.370
I want to free Goda's imprisoned soul.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:48.700
TOKEIZAKA TENNIS CLUB

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:54.900
Hey, did you hear about Coach Mitaka?

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:57.810
That he hasn't been at work
for a while...?

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.820
I thought he might have gone
on a trip,

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:04.070
but it seems he stays home every day
and plays with his dog.

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:05.360
His dog...?

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:12.090
I love dogs. Dogs are cute.

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:15.950
I never knew there were
adorable animals like this...

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:25.110
Come, McEnroe! Fly into my arms!

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:34.280
Dogs are adorable!
I...I...love dogs!

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:45.350
N-No! They are not!

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:54.060
This is no good...
I mustn't be discouraged by this!

00:08:55.070 --> 00:09:00.410
I must face this ordeal and someday,
I will triumph!

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.790
Here Soichiro, dinner.

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:12.280
I'm home.

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:17.690
Hi. That's right,
today is your tutoring session.

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:20.290
I have to get some refreshments.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:22.400
That's not necessary.

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:26.030
Don't be shy.
After all, it's only for this month.

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:27.040
Huh?

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:30.140
Are you continuing next month, too?

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:35.500
No, of course not! In this atmosphere,
Yagami can't concentrate either.

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:37.470
I think so, too!

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:40.440
What's she pulling?!

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:45.370
But, it's true...this atmosphere...

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.140
I don't want it to end like this...

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:08.410
Geez...

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:10.970
Be quiet!

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:22.020
It looks like they've settled down.

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:30.440
I'm so sorry, Yagami.

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:34.530
It would be good if you could study
in a quieter atmosphere...

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.540
As manager, it's my fault.

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:44.970
So because of that, we should
end this tutoring after next week...

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:50.150
I see.

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:53.690
I have one request, though...

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:57.090
Will you tutor me
at my house next week?

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:58.060
What?

00:10:58.940 --> 00:11:03.090
I want to study uninterrupted
at least this last time.

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:04.290
But that's...

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:06.900
Do you want to come
with us, Manager?

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:08.320
As a watchdog?

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:09.770
That's...

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:12.730
So it's okay, Godai?

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:20.780
Then, next week
in a better atmosphere...

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:27.100
A week has passed,
but I don't feel good about this...

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:33.560
Welcome!

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:35.990
Ah, thank you...

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:39.330
Come in, Godai.

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:42.490
Wait, I want to say hello
to your parents.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:44.360
Never mind that. Later.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.860
Well, then. Excuse me...

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.820
My room is upstairs.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.890
This is it, Godai.
Come in.

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:16.940
Both of my parents went to
a wedding and aren't home.

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:20.310
Then, could it be that there's just
you and me in this house...?

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.500
That's right! Just the two of us.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:44.630
Is Godai tutoring at Miss Yagami's
house tonight?

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:45.520
Yes...

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:48.130
Will it be all right?

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:49.710
What?

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:53.700
You can't tell what
that girl will do...

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:56.450
I'm sure everything will be okay.

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:58.880
Her parents are there, too...

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:00.550
I wonder...

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:02.350
Of course.

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:05.550
Are you going to peel the apple
to the core?

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:21.020
We won't be interrupted
by anyone tonight.

00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:22.830
Yeah...

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:26.500
What's the matter Godai?

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:31.340
Huh? I guess I'm just used to
things being noisy. This is too quiet...

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:38.190
Shall I put on some music?

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:52.540
How's this? Is it better?

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:53.860
Yes, well...

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:58.640
Ah, when are your parents
coming home?

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:02.440
Don't worry.
They said they'd be late, so rest easy.

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:05.220
That's why I'm worried...

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:06.450
Godai!

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:09.350
This problem...

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:11.420
Oww!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:13.480
Are you all right?

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:16.290
Ah! Don't come near me!

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:22.650
Geez, what are you so excited about?

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:24.830
N...Nothing...

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:29.970
Dad...!

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.570
Ibuki, we're home!

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:35.970
Ibuki! Aren't you here?

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:39.100
Oh, Dad, you're drunk!

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.880
I'm fine. Let me go!

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.590
Why are they home so early...

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.390
Godai, hide!

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:49.420
Hurry!

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:51.380
Why do I have to...?

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:54.890
The tutoring is a secret.

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:56.240
What!?

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:58.870
Are you here, Ibuki?

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:02.310
What's the matter, Dad?
You're early.

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:07.180
I was worried about you,
so I left early.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.100
What about me?

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:12.790
I hear that recently you've
been coming home late.

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:16.980
You're not meeting some
strange man out there, are you?

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:19.050
W-What brought that up?

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:21.790
Is there or isn't there someone?
Which is it?

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:24.100
Can't you trust me?

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:30.060
I want to, but it's a fact
his daughter...

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:34.440
Today was his
friend's daughter's wedding.

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:37.600
I understand his frustration.

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:40.230
She never talked about it and
they met behind his back.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:45.370
Then suddenly, they're getting married.
What's a father to do!!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:47.220
On top of that, he's inebriated.

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:50.110
A petty thief like that...

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:53.150
If it were me
I'd kill him with my bare hands!

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:56.430
How silly!

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:58.930
What do you mean by silly?!

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:02.840
I understand, so leave already!
I have an English test tomorrow!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:05.890
Come on, Dad.
You're interrupting her studies.

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:07.990
Here, I'm so worried about her...

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:18.110
I'm sorry Godai.

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:20.080
What's this all about?

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:24.350
He drank too much
at a friend's wedding...

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.510
I'm talking about the tutoring.

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:27.240
Huh?

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:30.480
Why did you hide it from your dad?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:34.150
Because Dad wouldn't allow it.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.360
But... What about my position!

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:37.980
Hey, Ibuki!

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:42.040
What is it, Dad?
Is there something else?

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:46.400
I just heard a man's voice.

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:50.610
Why would there be a man here?
You're so drunk...

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:54.680
But I'm sure, just now...

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:56.640
You're hearing things, that's what it is...

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:08.070
I've nothing to stand on...

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:10.160
Godai...

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:15.670
I'll go and get your shoes,
please leave through the window.

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:16.830
The window...?!

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:18.340
I'm not your secret lover
or anything.

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:20.600
Why do I have to leave
through the window?!

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:26.130
Oh, no, it broke!

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:33.530
I have a bad feeling about this...

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:48.700
Are you through studying already?

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:50.510
Yes, well...

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:52.840
Then come with me.

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:54.170
W...What is it?

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:55.510
Just come.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:03.980
Well, we haven't talked much recently...
Don't you think?

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:05.650
Oh...?

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:08.950
In any case, make me some tea.

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:10.590
Okay.

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:26.240
That Yagami, what's she doing...?

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:32.130
This is getting ridiculous.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:36.850
I don't have any reason
to be running and hiding!

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:44.120
They'll understand when they hear.

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:47.820
There's no reason to sneak around.
Go in with confidence!

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:55.200
Godai...!

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:01.840
What's that? He's sitting on my sneakers
and won't get off!?

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:02.870
What shall we do...?

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:06.640
Then the only thing to do
is confess the truth.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:11.410
You can't do that, now.
We can't go back now.

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.850
What do you mean, "we"?!

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:20.910
Lies are dangerous. In order to
sustain a lie, you must tell more lies.

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.560
In any case,
I'm going to talk to your father.

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:25.650
Godai!

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:33.360
Ibuki, is someone here?

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:35.510
Mom...

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:39.900
I thought I heard a voice.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:48.050
Actually, Mom,
I have my tutor here today.

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:50.790
What? Your tutor?

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:53.960
And where is this person?

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.480
Good evening.

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:07.870
Oh, it's you...

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:10.510
I'm sorry for coming in
while you were out...

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:14.180
We haven't done anything wrong.

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:16.430
Please believe us, Mom! It's just that...

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:20.050
You came home so suddenly
that I instinctively hid him.

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:21.910
That's good.

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:27.230
Dad empathized with
the father of the bride...

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:31.330
I'll obliterate any man
who comes near Ibuki...

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.920
If he had found you,
it would have been all over.

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:39.240
So, Mom, I have a favor...

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:43.100
Being a father is so sad...

00:20:46.230 --> 00:20:48.910
Dear, your bath is ready!

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:06.270
It's cold!

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:08.100
Here.

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:09.150
Thank you.

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:11.900
Come on, Godai. Leave while you can.

00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:13.540
I'll be leaving, then.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.340
I'm sorry for everything...

00:21:18.680 --> 00:21:23.590
Well, Yagami, it's too bad
our last session turned out like this...

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:31.060
We may never meet again,
but don't get distracted and study hard.

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:32.490
But...

00:21:33.340 --> 00:21:35.890
Mom! The bath's not hot!

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:38.270
Where are you, Mom!

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:39.430
Go on, hurry!

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:41.660
Be good!

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:44.030
Godai!

00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:49.770
A burglar!

00:21:50.090 --> 00:21:51.310
No, I'm not!

00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:56.480
A peeping tom! It's a peeping tom!

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.330
You're mistaken!

00:22:53.110 --> 00:22:54.700
G-Godai!

00:23:00.290 --> 00:23:01.250
I'm home...

00:23:01.620 --> 00:23:03.640
What in the world happened?

00:23:05.150 --> 00:23:08.910
All kinds of things,
but I got home safely...

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:12.620
Your shoes?

00:23:19.170 --> 00:23:22.010
Godai must have been in a panic.

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:29.100
I'll see you again, Godai.

00:23:45.590 --> 00:23:47.870
What? Mr. Yotsuya for Yagami?

00:23:47.950 --> 00:23:51.050
That's right, I became her tutor.

00:23:51.120 --> 00:23:52.820
Are you sure, Yagami?

00:23:52.890 --> 00:23:54.880
He's a pervert! A pervert!

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:59.780
Next time: "Yagami's Scream! The Dangers of
Private Lessons with Yotsuya!"

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:02.650
What is Mr. Yotsuya doing?
